WEBVTT

00:00:08.180 --> 00:00:09.240
Seriously?

00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:11.620
Tell me sooner...

00:00:12.660 --> 00:00:14.480
What should I do now?

00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:16.540
I don't feel like going home...

00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:19.450
Huh?

00:00:21.850 --> 00:00:23.330
The Spitting Woman!

00:00:25.730 --> 00:00:27.510
Is she meeting up with someone?

00:00:27.510 --> 00:00:28.880
That means...

00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:32.160
"I'm here!"

00:00:34.150 --> 00:00:36.240
20 minutes ahead of schedule!

00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:40.480
I just couldn't wait to hang out
together on our first day off in ages!

00:00:40.480 --> 00:00:43.310
And today is a special day, too!

00:00:43.310 --> 00:00:46.490
With guys constantly buzzing around her lately,

00:00:46.490 --> 00:00:49.510
I haven't been able to let my guard down at school.

00:00:49.510 --> 00:00:52.150
So today, I'll have as much fun as I can!

00:00:52.150 --> 00:00:53.430
Is she here yet?

00:00:54.410 --> 00:00:56.080
Anna!

00:00:56.350 --> 00:00:58.500
Even from a distance, she looks adorable!

00:00:59.150 --> 00:01:00.810
Sorry. Did I keep you waiting?

00:01:00.810 --> 00:01:03.090
No, I just got here.

00:01:03.090 --> 00:01:04.440
Where do we go first?

00:01:05.190 --> 00:01:06.920
Um... er...

00:01:08.090 --> 00:01:09.340
With Matsunaga-kun?

00:01:10.220 --> 00:01:11.240
Huh?!

00:01:11.240 --> 00:01:12.700
Where are you two going?

00:01:12.700 --> 00:01:14.940
That's none of your business!

00:01:14.940 --> 00:01:16.650
We're going shopping and such.

00:01:16.650 --> 00:01:18.090
I see!

00:01:18.090 --> 00:01:20.710
My plans got cancelled, so I've got nothing to do.

00:01:20.710 --> 00:01:21.560
Well, shall we go?

00:01:21.560 --> 00:01:23.410
Not with you, moron.

00:01:23.410 --> 00:01:24.980
Now beat it, you creep!

00:01:24.980 --> 00:01:26.220
Hang on!

00:01:26.220 --> 00:01:28.170
Just how am I creepy?

00:01:28.170 --> 00:01:29.130
I'm cool!

00:01:29.130 --> 00:01:29.900
Eww!

00:01:30.330 --> 00:01:32.820
Saying that about yourself?! Creep!

00:01:32.820 --> 00:01:34.150
Take a better look!

00:01:34.150 --> 00:01:35.060
Um...

00:01:35.060 --> 00:01:36.360
What about Hashiba-kun?

00:01:36.360 --> 00:01:38.750
Yeah, I bet Natsuki's free, too.

00:01:39.760 --> 00:01:40.910
Anna!

00:01:40.910 --> 00:01:42.900
What are you doing?!

00:01:42.900 --> 00:01:45.040
Heya! It's me!

00:03:17.010 --> 00:03:17.890
Sorry for the wait!

00:03:17.890 --> 00:03:20.350
Wow, that was quick!

00:03:20.350 --> 00:03:22.130
I pedaled super-hard.

00:03:22.130 --> 00:03:23.810
Really? Impressive.

00:03:24.090 --> 00:03:26.100
Hello, Hashiba-kun.

00:03:26.820 --> 00:03:27.480
Oh, hell—

00:03:27.480 --> 00:03:28.410
Whoa!

00:03:30.200 --> 00:03:32.600
Isn't it wrong for us to butt in on them like this?

00:03:32.600 --> 00:03:33.850
It's fine!

00:03:33.850 --> 00:03:35.320
She's always mad.

00:03:35.740 --> 00:03:38.790
Just consider yourself lucky to be able
to spend a day off with Kobayakawa-san!

00:03:38.790 --> 00:03:39.730
O-Oh, yeah.

00:03:39.730 --> 00:03:41.520
What're they talking about?

00:03:41.520 --> 00:03:43.040
That was delicious.

00:03:43.040 --> 00:03:45.670
Once Anna's made up her mind,
she doesn't change it easily.

00:03:45.670 --> 00:03:48.540
Wait, she actually looks
kind of happy about this!

00:03:48.540 --> 00:03:51.460
If that's how it's gonna be,
I'll get in his way all day!

00:03:56.420 --> 00:03:58.130
Lucky me!

00:03:58.130 --> 00:03:59.620
Flinging it at first place!

00:03:59.620 --> 00:04:01.340
Don't do that!

00:04:01.340 --> 00:04:03.680
You've got to be cruel in competitive play!

00:04:03.680 --> 00:04:06.260
Whoa, there are a ton of bananas!

00:04:06.260 --> 00:04:08.480
Sorry, that may have been me.

00:04:08.480 --> 00:04:10.620
Go!

00:04:13.440 --> 00:04:14.580
I came in first.

00:04:14.580 --> 00:04:15.400
I'm dead last!

00:04:16.690 --> 00:04:19.320
I managed to put him into last, somehow.

00:04:19.570 --> 00:04:21.030
What next?

00:04:21.030 --> 00:04:21.660
How about...

00:04:21.660 --> 00:04:22.750
Anna!

00:04:23.950 --> 00:04:25.160
I want to do that!

00:04:26.820 --> 00:04:28.440
I don't think I've tried it before.

00:04:28.440 --> 00:04:30.290
Then watch me play!

00:04:30.290 --> 00:04:32.260
Against the little monkey.

00:04:32.260 --> 00:04:33.840
What? Me?

00:04:34.190 --> 00:04:37.760
I'll show Anna just how lame you are!

00:04:38.110 --> 00:04:39.380
Wait, hold on.

00:04:39.380 --> 00:04:40.930
I'll play.

00:04:41.580 --> 00:04:43.810
Natsuki's terrible at this.

00:04:43.810 --> 00:04:46.560
This jerk always gets in the way!

00:04:46.930 --> 00:04:47.930
Fine, whatever!

00:04:49.520 --> 00:04:51.560
If he's gonna get in my way...

00:04:53.600 --> 00:04:54.770
...I'll take them both down!

00:04:56.530 --> 00:04:57.570
Together!

00:04:59.320 --> 00:05:01.100
Ah! I managed to get it.

00:05:01.100 --> 00:05:02.240
Wow.

00:05:03.530 --> 00:05:04.970
Here, all yours.

00:05:04.970 --> 00:05:06.660
Huh? You're giving it to me?

00:05:08.170 --> 00:05:09.440
Thanks.

00:05:09.440 --> 00:05:11.060
No problem.

00:05:12.580 --> 00:05:13.130
Kill more of them, would you!

00:05:13.130 --> 00:05:14.650
They're still at it.

00:05:14.650 --> 00:05:14.710
Yeah.

00:05:14.710 --> 00:05:15.710
I am!

00:05:16.040 --> 00:05:20.010
Tsutsui-san seems even
more worked up than usual.

00:05:20.010 --> 00:05:22.370
Sorry if we got in the way.

00:05:22.370 --> 00:05:23.090
No.

00:05:23.370 --> 00:05:26.010
I should apologize for inviting you so suddenly.

00:05:26.010 --> 00:05:28.190
It's nothing to apologize for!

00:05:28.190 --> 00:05:31.440
It really is more fun when we all play together.

00:05:33.340 --> 00:05:36.070
You really think so?

00:05:36.070 --> 00:05:36.790
Yeah!

00:05:36.790 --> 00:05:38.530
I'm sure we all feel that way.

00:05:40.230 --> 00:05:41.700
In that case...

00:05:47.380 --> 00:05:49.750
...I'd like to break away from the group for a bit.

00:05:50.480 --> 00:05:51.540
Huh?

00:05:56.550 --> 00:05:58.560
Th-This is mortifying...

00:05:58.560 --> 00:06:00.630
You're getting ahead of yourself, trying to beat me.

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:02.180
It's all wrong!

00:06:02.180 --> 00:06:04.450
It wasn't supposed to go like this!

00:06:04.450 --> 00:06:06.890
I need to see Anna's face to regain my power!

00:06:06.890 --> 00:06:08.810
Anna!

00:06:15.860 --> 00:06:16.820
She's gone!

00:06:17.280 --> 00:06:19.240
Are Natsuki and Kobayakawa-san gone?

00:06:19.240 --> 00:06:20.150
Smooth move!

00:06:20.610 --> 00:06:22.400
Well, shall both of us go somewhere—

00:06:22.400 --> 00:06:24.880
No! Look for them!

00:06:24.880 --> 00:06:26.500
Grr!

00:06:26.500 --> 00:06:28.410
Anna's not answering!

00:06:30.530 --> 00:06:32.630
Hey, did you get through?

00:06:32.630 --> 00:06:35.640
"She forgot something. Just wait for us," he says.

00:06:35.640 --> 00:06:36.760
That's a lie!

00:06:36.760 --> 00:06:38.610
Then why isn't she answering her phone?

00:06:38.610 --> 00:06:39.800
Maybe the battery's dead?

00:06:39.800 --> 00:06:41.880
Ugh, I'm sick of this!

00:06:41.880 --> 00:06:43.680
Come on, let's do the next game.

00:06:43.680 --> 00:06:44.430
I'm not playing.

00:06:46.160 --> 00:06:47.950
I'll wait here for Anna.

00:06:52.400 --> 00:06:54.550
What are you sitting down for?

00:06:54.550 --> 00:06:56.290
Waiting for Natsuki.

00:07:00.540 --> 00:07:02.570
This was supposed to be a special day.

00:07:02.910 --> 00:07:05.100
Don't let it get you that down.

00:07:05.100 --> 00:07:07.360
You had fun. Getting to play with me.

00:07:07.360 --> 00:07:08.490
It was not fun!

00:07:08.910 --> 00:07:11.120
Well, it was fun for me.

00:07:11.120 --> 00:07:14.460
It's boring for me if I can't be with Anna.

00:07:15.110 --> 00:07:16.040
And your face's creepy.

00:07:16.670 --> 00:07:19.590
I wonder why you're always like this.

00:07:19.590 --> 00:07:21.650
I've told you over and over.

00:07:21.650 --> 00:07:22.940
You're so obstinate.

00:07:22.940 --> 00:07:23.880
Yeah?

00:07:24.350 --> 00:07:27.050
You're in love, right? With Kobayakawa-san.

00:07:31.570 --> 00:07:32.970
Am I... wrong?

00:07:35.310 --> 00:07:36.170
Why so bashful?

00:07:36.170 --> 00:07:38.530
Because you started talking about love!

00:07:38.530 --> 00:07:39.710
It's embarrassing!

00:07:39.710 --> 00:07:40.820
I hit the bullseye, huh?

00:07:40.820 --> 00:07:42.170
Yeah, you did!

00:07:42.170 --> 00:07:43.780
Anna's the cutest in the world.

00:07:43.780 --> 00:07:46.080
Oh? You're so devoted to her.

00:07:46.080 --> 00:07:47.350
That's normal.

00:07:47.350 --> 00:07:49.450
I'd rather go out with lots of girls.

00:07:50.370 --> 00:07:51.450
What a creep.

00:07:52.150 --> 00:07:57.370
That's just how men are.
They lead you on, then betray you.

00:07:57.940 --> 00:08:00.100
They only ever think of themselves.

00:08:00.100 --> 00:08:01.170
I despise them!

00:08:01.600 --> 00:08:02.900
What was that?

00:08:02.900 --> 00:08:04.830
It's like something happened to you.

00:08:04.830 --> 00:08:06.240
Nothing happened.

00:08:06.240 --> 00:08:08.050
It's just how I feel.

00:08:08.050 --> 00:08:09.050
Where are you going?

00:08:09.050 --> 00:08:10.090
To get a drink.

00:08:10.090 --> 00:08:12.140
I'm thirsty.

00:08:18.050 --> 00:08:20.710
I may have said too much.

00:08:22.060 --> 00:08:22.990
Why did I?

00:08:24.880 --> 00:08:27.050
Yeah? Yeah?

00:08:27.050 --> 00:08:28.450
Kobayakawa-san's place?

00:08:29.990 --> 00:08:30.910
Sure.

00:08:30.910 --> 00:08:32.390
Got it.

00:08:32.390 --> 00:08:34.660
Then, we'll be just a bit longer...

00:08:38.120 --> 00:08:41.170
You do know after all!

00:08:41.510 --> 00:08:42.460
No, I...

00:08:42.670 --> 00:08:44.260
Where's Anna?!

00:08:44.260 --> 00:08:44.940
Hold on!

00:08:44.940 --> 00:08:46.120
Calm down.

00:08:46.120 --> 00:08:47.090
Shut up!

00:08:47.610 --> 00:08:49.050
Aren't you in league with the little monkey?!

00:08:49.370 --> 00:08:51.020
Ganging up on me behind my back!

00:08:51.020 --> 00:08:52.970
Men really are scum!

00:08:52.970 --> 00:08:56.560
I'll bet you're all making fun of me and laughing!

00:08:56.560 --> 00:08:59.350
When have I ever made fun of you?

00:08:59.350 --> 00:09:00.520
Wha—?

00:09:00.850 --> 00:09:01.600
But...

00:09:02.930 --> 00:09:03.650
Come along.

00:09:03.920 --> 00:09:06.150
N-No, let go of me!

00:09:06.150 --> 00:09:08.110
Don't you want to see Kobayakawa-san?

00:09:08.690 --> 00:09:11.160
Besides, you're all about yourself, too!

00:09:11.920 --> 00:09:13.780
Trust others a bit more!

00:09:19.140 --> 00:09:20.120
Again?

00:09:20.540 --> 00:09:21.530
Anna!

00:09:22.390 --> 00:09:23.460
One, two...

00:09:23.830 --> 00:09:25.880
Happy birthday!

00:09:26.650 --> 00:09:28.230
What is this?

00:09:28.230 --> 00:09:29.970
A-Anna!

00:09:30.420 --> 00:09:32.890
Anna!!

00:09:32.890 --> 00:09:35.180
I was so scared when you disappeared like that!

00:09:35.180 --> 00:09:36.290
Mari-chan...

00:09:37.480 --> 00:09:37.530
That hurts

00:09:37.530 --> 00:09:38.480
Anna!

00:09:38.480 --> 00:09:40.010
Real live yuri!

00:09:40.830 --> 00:09:41.940
Here.

00:09:41.940 --> 00:09:43.440
From me and Tsuyoponnu.

00:09:44.560 --> 00:09:46.270
I think they'll look great on you!

00:09:46.270 --> 00:09:47.680
They're cat ears!

00:09:47.680 --> 00:09:49.150
Cat ears?!

00:09:49.150 --> 00:09:50.030
Um...

00:09:50.620 --> 00:09:51.760
Tsutsui-san.

00:09:51.760 --> 00:09:53.810
This is from the three of us.

00:09:53.810 --> 00:09:55.160
Happy birthday.

00:09:55.160 --> 00:09:55.990
Huh?

00:09:55.990 --> 00:09:56.700
Why?

00:09:57.170 --> 00:09:59.370
You've been getting along with us more.

00:09:59.370 --> 00:10:02.070
Marippe, just take it!

00:10:08.660 --> 00:10:09.660
Mari-chan.

00:10:11.180 --> 00:10:13.130
Here, from me.

00:10:13.130 --> 00:10:15.380
Sorry for surprising you.

00:10:15.380 --> 00:10:18.380
I thought it would be nice
to celebrate with everyone,

00:10:18.380 --> 00:10:21.520
so I had Hashiba-kun help me
get all this together quickly.

00:10:21.850 --> 00:10:22.890
Huh...?

00:10:23.360 --> 00:10:25.900
Happy birthday.

00:10:26.590 --> 00:10:29.110
Thank... you...

00:10:31.980 --> 00:10:33.600
Marippe's gone from tsun to dere!

00:10:33.600 --> 00:10:35.530
That was only meant for Anna!

00:10:35.860 --> 00:10:38.840
Hey, let's sing the birthday song!

00:10:38.840 --> 00:10:39.890
Sounds good!

00:10:40.840 --> 00:10:42.350
Hey there, birthday girl.

00:10:42.350 --> 00:10:43.830
Ack!

00:10:43.830 --> 00:10:44.920
Enjoying yourself?

00:10:45.410 --> 00:10:47.040
Kinda, I guess...

00:10:47.040 --> 00:10:48.010
Huh?

00:10:48.010 --> 00:10:49.540
You actually admitted it.

00:10:49.540 --> 00:10:51.550
Could it be, you're starting to fall for—

00:10:51.910 --> 00:10:54.240
As long as you stay away from me!

00:10:56.770 --> 00:10:58.580
She really isn't the least bit cute.

00:11:03.770 --> 00:11:06.230
I don't want to fight a losing battle.

00:11:07.120 --> 00:11:08.210
So, then...

00:11:08.210 --> 00:11:09.150
What am I gonna do?

00:11:09.890 --> 00:11:11.630
What's with me?

00:11:11.630 --> 00:11:12.530
Huh?

00:11:12.780 --> 00:11:14.240
Onii-chan?
